  "en": "Integration by parts",
  "kn": "ಭಾಗಶಃ ಸಮಾಕಲನ"
 },
 "minutes": 40,
 "blocks": [
  {
   "id": "intro",
   "type": "intro",
   "heading": {
    "en": "A product with no shortcut",
    "kn": "ಸುಲಭ ದಾರಿಯಿಲ್ಲದ ಗುಣಲಬ್ಧ"
   },
   "hook": {
    "en": "How do you integrate x cos x? No substitution works. Integration by parts turns the product rule of differentiation around and trades it for an easier integral.",
    "kn": "x cos x ಅನ್ನು ಹೇಗೆ ಸಮಾಕಲಿಸುವುದು? ಯಾವ ಆದೇಶವೂ ಕೆಲಸ ಮಾಡುವುದಿಲ್ಲ. ಭಾಗಶಃ ಸಮಾಕಲನ ಗುಣಲಬ್ಧ ನಿಯಮವನ್ನು ಹಿಮ್ಮುಖಗೊಳಿಸಿ ಸುಲಭ ಸಮಾಕಲನವನ್ನಾಗಿಸುತ್ತದೆ."
   },
   "objectives": [
    {
     "en": "Apply integration by parts"
    },
    {
     "en": "Choose the first function with ILATE"
    },
    {
     "en": "Use ∫eˣ[f(x) + f′(x)] dx = eˣ f(x) + C"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "How do you integrate x cos x? No substitution works. Integration by parts turns the product rule of differentiation around and trades it for an easier integral.",
    "kn": "x cos x ಅನ್ನು ಹೇಗೆ ಸಮಾಕಲಿಸುವುದು? ಯಾವ ಆದೇಶವೂ ಕೆಲಸ ಮಾಡುವುದಿಲ್ಲ. ಭಾಗಶಃ ಸಮಾಕಲನ ಗುಣಲಬ್ಧ ನಿಯಮವನ್ನು ಹಿಮ್ಮುಖಗೊಳಿಸಿ ಸುಲಭ ಸಮಾಕಲನವನ್ನಾಗಿಸುತ್ತದೆ."
   }
  },
  {
   "id": "concept1",
   "type": "concept",
   "title": {
    "en": "By parts"
   },
   "body": {
    "en": "$\\int u\\,v\\,dx = u\\int v\\,dx - \\int\\left(\\frac{du}{dx}\\int v\\,dx\\right)dx$. Take as $u$ (first function) the one that becomes simpler when differentiated; choose it in the order ILATE: Inverse trig, Logarithmic, Algebraic, Trigonometric, Exponential.",
    "kn": "∫u v dx = u∫v dx − ∫(u′ ∫v dx) dx. ಮೊದಲ ಫಲನ u ಅನ್ನು ILATE ಕ್ರಮದಲ್ಲಿ ಆರಿಸಿ: ವಿಲೋಮ ತ್ರಿಕೋನಮಿತೀಯ, ಲಘುಗಣಕ, ಬೀಜಗಣಿತೀಯ, ತ್ರಿಕೋನಮಿತೀಯ, ಘಾತೀಯ."
   },
   "points": [
    {
     "en": "First function u: earlier in ILATE"
    },
    {
     "en": "Second function v: one you can integrate"
    },
    {
     "en": "∫log x dx: take v = 1"
    }
   ],
   "narration": {
    "en": "Integral of u v equals u times integral of v, minus integral of u dash times integral of v. Choose u by ILATE: inverse trig, log, algebraic, trig, exponential.",
    "kn": "∫u v dx = u∫v dx − ∫(u′ ∫v dx) dx. ಮೊದಲ ಫಲನ u ಅನ್ನು ILATE ಕ್ರಮದಲ್ಲಿ ಆರಿಸಿ: ವಿಲೋಮ ತ್ರಿಕೋನಮಿತೀಯ, ಲಘುಗಣಕ, ಬೀಜಗಣಿತೀಯ, ತ್ರಿಕೋನಮಿತೀಯ, ಘಾತೀಯ."
   },
   "formula": "\\int u\\,v\\,dx = u\\int v\\,dx - \\int\\left(u'\\int v\\,dx\\right)dx"
  },
